{
 "file": "mountain",
 "head": {
  "name": "Mountain",
  "description": "Mountain is a power based practice that strengthens the body and the mind by instilling a sense of self-discipline, staying power, and one pointed concentration.  In the Mountain practice we move slowly with less vinyasa flow between postures.  In addition, we hold our poses significantly longer; do more arm balances as well as other strength building postures.\n\n\"Your practice begins when you want to come out of a pose.\"",
